From ff0f8a7ceee735e505bb77d2fb65590f613b5739 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:26:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] gpio: msc313: add SSD20xD interrupts and register
 locking

Add interrupt support for SSD20xD and serialise the read-modify-write
of the per-pin registers with a spinlock.

Taken from the final state of the linux-chenxing mstar_v6_7_rebase branch
(https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux, Daniel Palmer et al.) and ported
to v7.3. The .set callback now returns int as 7.3 requires.
Includes the MStar/SigmaStar GPIO dt-binding headers.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
